Description: The goal of 'vervets' is to provide users with an easy and simple way to go about sample discovery, project planning, and interoperable access to a variety of public datasets generated by the International Vervet Research Consortium (IVRC), representing data collected from 2,315 wild savanna monkeys from across Africa and the Caribbean. This package is currently in the early stages of development, so more to come!
